  "notes": [
    "www.imo.net served a site-restoration shell (HTTP 200, text/html) instead of the PDF; bytes were read from the pinned Internet Archive snapshot: https://www.imo.net/files/meteor-shower/cal2026.pdf answered text/html with 2980 bytes at 2026-10-08T23:58:46Z",
    "read the pinned Internet Archive snapshot instead: https://web.archive.org/web/20250712192730id_/https://www.imo.net/files/meteor-shower/cal2026.pdf",
    "URL actually read (https://web.archive.org/web/20250712192730id_/https://www.imo.net/files/meteor-shower/cal2026.pdf) differs from the canonical URL (https://www.imo.net/files/meteor-shower/cal2026.pdf)",
    "Table 5 was read from the PDF text layer with pypdf and normalised; that exact text, the pinned retrieval URL and the PDF SHA-256 are committed as tests/fixtures/overhead/imo-calendar-2026-table5.txt, which tests/overhead-meteors-data.cjs re-parses offline without any network access.",
